:: Dramatis_Personae [codex] {"position":"260,240","size":"100,100"}
## 👥 Dramatis Personae (Cast of Characters)

### Marcus Hale *(protagonist)*
A skeptical junior real estate broker whose impulsive need to prove himself masks a deep moral wound: his last deal cost a colleague their career and livelihood. Thrust from mundane onboarding into accidental activation of an ancient device, he must navigate shifting eras while confronting whether he will repeat the same selfish patterns across centuries or break the cycle.

### Harlan Voss *(antagonist)*
Immortal high priest of the cult and CEO of the organization. In every era he appears as the apex authority—modern CEO, medieval king, 1960s warden—driven by the belief that all souls are eternal property to be harvested when timelines merge.

### Sophia Reyes *(ally)*
Marcus's modern coworker whose career was nearly destroyed by his past deal; she is a reincarnated soul who begins remembering fragments once the spire activates.

### Lila Hart *(ally)*
A free-spirited 1960s art student and activist whose soul has been recycled through the spire; she remembers pieces of the medieval and modern eras in drug-fueled visions.

### Isabella Duarte *(ally)*
A noblewoman and secret scholar in the medieval court who has been positioned as Harlan's consort for centuries; she secretly records ritual fragments while surviving as property.

### Vivian Slate *(antagonist_ally)*
Harlan's immortal enforcer who appears as a corporate fixer, 1960s college dean, and medieval inquisitor; she has been his lover and weapon across every era.

### Nora Ellison *(neutral)*
A pragmatic 1960s university librarian and occult hobbyist who has pieced together fragments of the spire's history through banned books and campus disappearances.

### Elena Crowe *(neutral)*
A sharp-tongued medieval herbalist and midwife branded a witch; she has survived by selling temporal secrets to both Harlan's cult and those who oppose it.

### Marcus Hale *(Junior Real Estate Broker)*
### Harlan Voss *(Immortal Cult Leader and CEO)*
### Sophia Reyes *(Executive Assistant and Reincarnated Colleague)*
### Lady Isolde Veyra *(Court Advisor and Reincarnated Soul)*
