### Lena Hart *(Student Activist and Reincarnated Ally)*
### Mira Solen *(Artifact Archivist and Soul Librarian)*
### Elara Quinn *(Visionary Oracle and Timeline Seer)*
### Sarah Kline *(Spectral Informant and Archive Ghost)*

